Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.66,0:00:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.45,0:00:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like the cherry blossoms have reached their end for this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.22,0:00:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! Tomorrow is a holiday, so let's all go flower viewing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.32,0:00:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.35,0:00:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.96,0:00:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we make lunches to bring with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:00:58.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:00:59.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I'll make some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.91,0:01:01.57,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, c'mon now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.22,0:01:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.57,0:01:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.23,0:01:03.41,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I'm sorry... I went off and decided on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, don't worry about it{it's no worry}... I'm fine with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring something as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's always causing you trouble too...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so? Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll meet tomorrow at 8:00, in the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:39.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.78,0:01:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's early!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.20,0:01:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, 9:00 then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.74,0:01:45.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're supposed to view flowers in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, then 10:00...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I have to watch Grand Sazer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.45,0:01:53.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Guess it'll have to be afternoon after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.51,0:02:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.03,0:02:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where do we keep the water bottles?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Below the sink, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It may rain tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A "spring storm", they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A storm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.80,0:02:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! It's raining already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:30.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Holy crap... It's really coming down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make teru teru bouzu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:02:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.52,0:03:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The rain's stopped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh, we did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.14,0:03:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The teru teru bouzu saved the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Am I dressed a bit too drab?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can smell the greenery!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.25,0:03:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All the flowers are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.30,0:03:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.05,0:03:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.12,0:03:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.61,0:04:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sky's in full bloom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:40.54,Signs,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,500)\shad3\fnArial Rounded MT Bold\fs50\pos(340,133)}「Sky in Full Bloom」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
